ass="tab-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 7h10M18 7h2M4 17h4M12 17h8"></path> <circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2"></circle> <circle cx="10" cy="17" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="tab-no" aria-hidden="true">07</span> <span class="tab-label">Rules</span> <span class="tab-short">Rules</span></a></div><div class="side-group side-group--foot"><a href="/admin/account" class="tab-link"><svg class="tab-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13"></path> <path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"></path></svg><span class="tab-no" aria-hidden="true">··</span> <span class="tab-label">Account</span> <span class="tab-short">Account</span></a></div></nav><div class="side-foot"><p class="side-who"><span class="side-who-label">Signed in as</span> <span class="side-who-name"></span> <span class="side-who-role"></span></p><form method="post" action="/admin/logout"><button type="submit" class="btn btn--quiet side-signout">Sign out</button></form></div></div><main class="panel-main"><div class="panel-well"><div class="panel-head"><div class="panel-head-row"><div class="panel-head-text"><p class="lbl">Hours per person · week 37</p></div><div class="panel-actions"><div role="group" aria-label="Week" class="inline-flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper max-md:w-full"><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-ink hover:bg-ink/5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ink" href="/admin/reports?week=2026-09-06" aria-label="Previous week"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"></path></svg></a> <span class="px-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-ink">7 – 13 Sep</span> <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-ink hover:bg-ink/5 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ink" href="/admin/reports?week=2026-09-14" aria-label="Next week"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div><a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center px-2 font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink underline underline-offset-4 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ink" href="/admin/reports">This week</a> <a class="btn btn--line gap-2" href="/admin/reports.csv?week=2026-09-07" download><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 20h14"></path></svg> CSV for the accountant</a></div></div></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:flex-wrap md:items-end md:justify-between"><form class="flex items-end gap-2" method="get" action="/admin/reports" aria-label="Choose a week"><div class="field-stack w-44"><label class="lbl" for="report-week">Week containing</label> <input class="field-input field-input--mono" id="report-week" type="date" name="week" value="2026-09-07"></div><button class="btn btn--line" type="submit">Show</button></form><p class="font-mono text-xs leading-normal text-ink/70 md:max-w-md">The CSV holds every person and every open check-in — the lists below are shortened, the file is not.</p></div>     <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 desk:grid desk:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(280px,320px)] desk:items-start desk:gap-7"><aside aria-label="Week total" class="min-w-0 py-2 desk:col-start-2 desk:row-start-1"><div class="docket flex flex-col gap-3.5 px-[18px] pb-5 pt-[18px] md:grid md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] md:items-start md:gap-[22px] md:px-[22px] desk:flex desk:flex-col desk:gap-3.5 desk:px-6 desk:pb-[26px] desk:pt-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 desk:gap-3.5"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 text-center md:flex-row md:flex-wrap md:items-baseline md:justify-between md:gap-2 md:text-left desk:flex-col desk:items-center desk:gap-0.5 desk:text-center"><p class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Holdingless Ltd</p><p class="lbl">Week 37 · Mon 7 – Sun 13 September 2026 · Europe/Malta</p></div><dl class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-t border-dashed border-line pt-2.5 text-[13px] text-ink"><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>People with hours</dt><dd class="whitespace-nowrap text-right">1</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>Worked shifts</dt><dd class="whitespace-nowrap text-right">1</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>Arrivals typed by a manager</dt><dd class="whitespace-nowrap text-right">0</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>Approved on The Spike</dt><dd class="whitespace-nowrap text-right">0</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>Open check-ins, not counted</dt><dd class="whitespace-nowrap text-right">0</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>Waiting for a decision</dt><dd class="whitespace-nowrap text-right">0h 00m</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>A manager refused</dt><dd class="whitespace-nowrap text-right">0h 00m</dd></div></dl><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 border-t border-dashed border-line pt-2.5 text-ink"><p class="text-[13px] font-bold">TOTAL<span class="sr-only">, hours worked this week</span></p><p class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-[26px] desk:text-3xl">8h 00m</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 font-display text-xs leading-normal text-ink/70"><p>1 shift across 1 person. A shift counts on the day it STARTED, so an overnight shift belongs to the evening it began.</p></div><p class="text-center font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.1em] text-ink/70" aria-hidden="true">— PUNCHLESS · TAPTIME —</p></div></div></aside><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-6 desk:col-start-1 desk:row-start-1"> <section aria-label="Hours by person" class="min-w-0 rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-paper max-md:rounded-none max-md:border-0 max-md:bg-transparent"><div class="overflow-x-auto pb-1 pt-2 max-md:overflow-visible max-md:p-0"><table class="roll-table"><thead class="max-md:sr-only"><tr><th scope="col" class="lbl py-3 pl-5 pr-2 text-left font-normal">Person</th><th scope="col" class="lbl whitespace-nowrap px-0.5 py-3 text-center font-normal tracking-[0.06em]">Mon 7</th><th scope="col" class="lbl whitespace-nowrap px-0.5 py-3 text-center font-normal tracking-[0.06em]">Tue 8</th><th scope="col" class="lbl whitespace-nowrap px-0.5 py-3 text-center font-normal tracking-[0.06em]">Wed 9</th><th scope="col" class="lbl whitespace-nowrap px-0.5 py-3 text-center font-normal tracking-[0.06em]">Thu 10</th><th scope="col" class="lbl whitespace-nowrap px-0.5 py-3 text-center font-normal tracking-[0.06em]">Fri 11</th><th scope="col" class="lbl whitespace-nowrap px-0.5 py-3 text-center font-normal tracking-[0.06em]">Sat 12</th><th scope="col" class="lbl whitespace-nowrap px-0.5 py-3 text-center font-normal tracking-[0.06em]">Sun 13</th><th scope="col" class="lbl py-3 pl-2 pr-5 text-right font-normal">Total</th></tr></thead> <tbody class="roll-body"><tr class="roll-row"><th scope="row" class="roll-who"><span class="roll-name">Maria Borg</span> </th><td class="roll-day"><span class="roll-letter" aria-hidden="true">Mon</span><span class="roll-cell roll-cell--none"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span> <span class="sr-only">no hours counted</span></span></td><td class="roll-day"><span class="roll-letter" aria-hidden="true">Tue</span><span class="roll-cell roll-cell--none"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span> <span class="sr-only">no hours counted</span></span></td><td class="roll-day"><span class="roll-letter" aria-hidden="true">Wed</span><span class="roll-cell roll-cell--none"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span> <span class="sr-only">no hours counted</span></span></td><td class="roll-day"><span class="roll-letter" aria-hidden="true">Thu</span><span class="roll-cell roll-cell--none"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span> <span class="sr-only">no hours counted</span></span></td><td class="roll-day"><span class="roll-letter" aria-hidden="true">Fri</span><span class="roll-cell roll-cell--none"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span> <span class="sr-only">no hours counted</span></span></td><td class="roll-day"><span class="roll-letter" aria-hidden="true">Sat</span><span class="roll-cell roll-cell--none"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span> <span class="sr-only">no hours counted</span></span></td><td class="roll-day"><span class="roll-letter" aria-hidden="true">Sun</span><span class="roll-cell roll-cell--none"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span> <span class="sr-only">no hours counted</span></span></td><td class="roll-sum">8h 00m<span class="roll-shifts">1 shift</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-line px-5 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-ink/70 max-md:border-0 max-md:px-0"><p class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-[18px] gap-y-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block size-3 rounded-[3px] bg-tappa-green/15" aria-hidden="true"></span>worked</span> <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block size-3 rounded-[3px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-ink" aria-hidden="true"></span>at a venue other than their home venue</span> <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="inline-block size-3 rounded-[3px] border border-dashed border-saffron bg-saffron/10" aria-hidden="true"></span>open check-in, not counted</span> <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="rounded-[3px] border border-ink/70 px-1 text-[10px] font-bold" aria-hidden="true">M</span>check-in typed by a manager</span> <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span aria-hidden="true">—</span>no hours counted</span></p></div></section><section aria-labelledby="roll-venues" class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><h2 id="roll-venues" class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-xl">Per venue</h2><ul class="grid grid-cols-1 overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-paper md:grid-cols-2"><li class="-mb-px flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2.5 border-b border-dashed border-line px-[18px] py-3"><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-0.5"><span class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink">St Julians</span> <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-ink/70">1 shift started here</span></span> <span class="whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-sm font-bold text-ink">8h 00m</span></li></ul></section></div></div></div></main><nav class="bar" aria-label="Panel sections, phone"><a href="/admin" class="bar-link"><span class="bar-pill"><svg class="nav-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 5h18"></path> <path d="M7.5 5v3M17.5 5v3"></path> <rect x="5" y="8" width="5" height="9" rx="1"></rect> <rect x="15" y="8" width="5" height="11" rx="1"></rect></svg></span> <span>Pass</span></a> <a href="/admin/review" class="bar-link"><span class="bar-pill"><svg class="nav-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3v18"></path> <path d="M7 21h10"></path> <rect x="6" y="9" width="12" height="7" rx="1"></rect></svg></span> <span>Spike</span><span class="tab-count" aria-label="the